Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Register the glc: URL scheme for the current user (issue #199), so a gram
; page's "WAV N" link opens the .glc in the legacy replay tool.
; Per-user (HKEY_CURRENT_USER): no administrator rights needed.
;
; STAND-ALONE PCs ONLY. Domain PCs get the handler from Group Policy (HKLM,
; script under C:\Program Files\AAAC\, no -ExecutionPolicy switch); see
; theme/glc-launch/README.md. -ExecutionPolicy Bypass is here only because a
; stand-alone PC has no policy permitting the script.
;
; BEFORE IMPORTING: the path below must be where glc-launch.ps1 was copied.
; Edit it if you used another folder - every backslash written twice.
; See theme/glc-launch/README.md.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\glc]
@="URL:Gram replay link"
"URL Protocol"=""

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\glc\shell]

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\glc\shell\open]

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\glc\shell\open\command]
@="powershell.exe -NoProfile -NonInteractive -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -WindowStyle Hidden -File \"C:\\aaac\\glc-launch.ps1\" \"%1\""
